    <briefdescription>
<para>An abstract base class for streams implementations that also support a pwrite operation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is useful for code that can mostly stream out data, but needs to patch in a header that needs to know the output size. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
